<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Ubuntu; Linux x86_64; rv:145.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/145.0" version="29.1.1">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="F6mqMJiX2M7LyhzPdkza">
    <mxGraphModel dx="5774" dy="3371" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\n&#39; CRM Feedback Analyzer — Architecture (Simplified, Vertical Layout)\n\nskinparam dpi 150\nskinparam backgroundColor #F3F4F6\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam ArrowColor #222222\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\ntop to bottom direction\ntitle CRM Feedback Analyzer — Architecture (Simplified, Vertical Layout)\n\nactor \&quot;User\&quot; as User\n\n&#39; ===== Processing of Inputs (TOP) =====\npackage \&quot;Processing of Inputs\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;Upload / API\\n(React UI → Node API)\&quot; as UI\n  rectangle \&quot;Input Handler\\n• Read Excel (.xlsx/.csv)\\n• Column selection &amp; validation\&quot; as Input\n  rectangle \&quot;Preprocessor\\n• Normalize text\\n• Remove HTML, URLs, emojis\\n• Deduplicate\&quot; as Preproc\n  rectangle \&quot;Tokenizer\\n• Hugging Face tokenization\\n• Batch creation\&quot; as Tokenizer\n}\n\n&#39; ===== Model Execution (MIDDLE) =====\npackage \&quot;Model Execution\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;Model Wrapper Layer\\n(common interface: load/predict)\&quot; as Wrapper\n  component \&quot;Sarcasm Model\\n(fine-tuned transformer)\&quot; as Sarcasm\n  component \&quot;Sentiment Model\\n(fine-tuned transformer)\&quot; as Sentiment\n  component \&quot;Emotion Model\\n(fine-tuned transformer)\&quot; as Emotion\n  component \&quot;Urgency Model\\n(fine-tuned transformer)\&quot; as Urgency\n}\n\n&#39; ===== Generation of Structured Output (BOTTOM) =====\npackage \&quot;Generation of Structured Output\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;Result Merger\\n• Combine model outputs\\n• Simple rule adjustments\\n• Confidence thresholds\&quot; as Merger\n  rectangle \&quot;Export Engine\\n• Excel writer (pandas/openpyxl)\\n• Download endpoint / charts\&quot; as Export\n  rectangle \&quot;Storage / Cache\\n• Redis / local cache (optional)\&quot; as Cache\n}\n\n&#39; ===== Workflow Connections (TOP → MIDDLE → BOTTOM) =====\nUser --&gt; UI\nUI --&gt; Input\nInput --&gt; Preproc\nPreproc --&gt; Tokenizer\nTokenizer --&gt; Wrapper\n\n&#39; Model calls\nWrapper --&gt; Sarcasm\nWrapper --&gt; Sentiment\nWrapper --&gt; Emotion\nWrapper --&gt; Urgency\n\n&#39; Sarcasm influences Sentiment and Emotion (UPDATED)\nSarcasm -down-&gt; Sentiment : sarcasm_flag\\n(yes/no)\nSarcasm -down-&gt; Emotion   : sarcasm_flag\\n(yes/no)\n\n&#39; Outputs flow downward to merged results\nSarcasm --&gt; Merger\nSentiment --&gt; Merger\nEmotion --&gt; Merger\nUrgency --&gt; Merger\n\n&#39; Final outputs\nMerger --&gt; Export\nMerger --&gt; Cache\nExport --&gt; UI : report link / download\nUI --&gt; User : display table &amp; charts\n\n&#39; Logging &amp; Monitoring note\nnote right of Wrapper\n  Logging &amp; Monitoring:\n  • logs, basic metrics\n  • sample store for manual review\nend note\n\n\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="mXuo7luYaYj88UC3hIw--4">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1970" width="1422" x="-1140" y="-700" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
